source 2024 Farashahi--Fadavi--Sabbaghian, Faster Complete Addition Laws for Montgomery Curves, Theorems 2-3; transfer of general extended Edwards addition via linear maps (33)-(34), https://ches.iacr.org/2024/papers-issue-4/4_111.pdf
parameter ta
parameter td
assume ta*b = a+2
assume td*b = a-2
compute X1 = U1+W1
compute Y1 = V1-S1
compute T1 = U1-W1
compute Z1 = V1+S1
compute X2 = U2+W2
compute Y2 = V2-S2
compute T2 = U2-W2
compute Z2 = V2+S2
compute A = X1*X2
compute B = Y1*Y2
compute C = td*T1*T2
compute D = Z1*Z2
compute E = (X1+Y1)*(X2+Y2)-A-B
compute F = D-C
compute G = D+C
compute H = B-ta*A
compute X3 = E*F
compute Y3 = G*H
compute T3 = E*H
compute Z3 = F*G
compute U3 = X3+T3
compute V3 = Z3+Y3
compute S3 = Z3-Y3
compute W3 = X3-T3
